+本页下列测试数字和 Forge 观察继承自上游，不能作为 MCServer NeoForge 1.21.1 fork 的已通过记录。本 fork 的实现范围、独立验证门槛和当前未验收项目见[MCServer port](../mcserver-neoforge-port.md)。
+
+## MCServer community fork evidence (2026-10-17 KST)
+
+The development JAR targets Minecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge 21.1.256 / Java 21 and contains Mach-O ARM64 macOS and PE Windows x64 native libraries. A successful CI build is recorded in [GitHub Actions](https://github.com/allie-31234131/mcserver-modpack/actions/runs/38999351655). It is a development build, not a release; exact artifact checksums are kept with the specific build output.
